  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jer-integration\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/full_jer-integration_downloads.svg?badge_style=for_the_badge\" alt=\"Downloads\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jer-integration/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/jer-integration.svg?badge_style=for_the_badge\" alt=\"Versions\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Janoeo/JER-Integration/blob/master/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/Janoeo/JER-Integration?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"license\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/KkzqnzA\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/630863620842061877?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"discord\"></a></p>\n<h2>關於 JER Integration</h2>\n<p><em><strong>JER Integration</strong></em> 是一款為 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-resources-jer\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Resources (JER)</a> 增加更多可計算性的模組。</p>\n<p>為了實現這一功能，JER Integration 實現了以下相容性補丁：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>生物掉落物（新增生物掉落的物品）</li>\n<li>地牢戰利品（新增遺漏的战利品表）</li>\n<li>礦脈生成（新增遺漏的礦石）</li>\n<li>植物掉落物（新增植物的掉落物）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>目前的相容性列表可在「相依性」章節中找到。</p>\n<h3>相依性</h3>\n<p><strong>必要項目</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Items (JEI)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-resources-jer\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Resources (JER)</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>選用 / 相容項目</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>相容模組可能會有很多變化，您可以在檔案相依性列表中查看目前支援的相容模組</li>\n<li>或查閱 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.alasdiablo.fr%252fjer-integration%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">JER Integration</a> 線上文件</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>貢獻</h2>\n<p>如果您想貢獻，可以透過以下方式進行：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Janoeo/JER-Integration/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">回報錯誤</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Janoeo/JER-Integration/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">功能請求</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Janoeo/JER-Integration/pulls\" rel=\"nofollow\">修復錯誤</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Janoeo/JER-Integration/pulls\" rel=\"nofollow\">任何有用的程式碼變更</a></li>\n<li>如果您想捐贈，我們目前無法接受，因為我們沒有 Patreon（或類似平台）。現在您只需要在 CurseForge 上下載該模組即可！</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>授權條款</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原始碼採用 <a href=\"https://github.com/Janoeo/JER-Integration/blob/master/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\">MIT 授權</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>聯絡方式</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>請透過 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/KkzqnzA\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> 與我們聯繫</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>致謝</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/AlasDiablo\" rel=\"nofollow\">AlasDiablo</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/liotamiu\" rel=\"nofollow\">lIotaMiu</a> - 原作者，主要貢獻者</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dadadodu\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dadadodu</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/Safyrus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Safyrus</a> - 測試、建議</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Janoeo/JER-Integration/graphs/contributors\" rel=\"nofollow\">所有貢獻者</a> - 回報錯誤、修復錯誤</li>\n<li>以及下載我模組的各位玩家！</li>\n</ul>",
